---
import MBPRLayout from "../layouts/MBPRLayout.astro";
---
<MBPRLayout title="Resource Center | Mission Bay Puppy Rescue" description="Puppy care guides, training tips, vet resources, and community rescue partners from Mission Bay Puppy Rescue.">
<section class="page-intro">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Bookmark This Page</span>
    <h1>MBPR Puppy Resource Center</h1>
    <p class="lede">Everything a new puppy parent needs &mdash; the one link we hand every adopter after they bring their pup home.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section tight">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-4">
      <div class="resource-tile">
      <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 11.5L12 4l8 7.5"/><path d="M6 10v9h12v-9"/><path d="M10 19v-5h4v5"/></svg></div>
      <h4>Bringing Your Puppy Home</h4>
      <p>First 24-48 hours, first night, and settling in.</p>
      <a class="link-quiet" href="#">Read Guide &rarr;</a>
    </div>
<div class="resource-tile">
      <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4.2"/><path d="M12 2v3M12 19v3M4.2 4.2l2.1 2.1M17.7 17.7l2.1 2.1M2 12h3M19 12h3M4.2 19.8l2.1-2.1M17.7 6.3l2.1-2.1"/></svg></div>
      <h4>Sleeping &amp; Crate Setup</h4>
      <p>Nighttime kennel setup and a calm bedtime routine.</p>
      <a class="link-quiet" href="#">Read Guide &rarr;</a>
    </div>
<div class="resource-tile">
      <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="4.5" width="12" height="16" rx="1.5"/><rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="3" rx="1"/><path d="M9 11h6M9 14.5h6M9 17.5h3.5"/></svg></div>
      <h4>Daytime Puppy Pen Setup</h4>
      <p>Sleeping, play, water, and potty areas done right.</p>
      <a class="link-quiet" href="#">Read Guide &rarr;</a>
    </div>
<div class="resource-tile">
      <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 8.2a2.3 2.3 0 113.6 2.7l6.4 6.4a2.3 2.3 0 11-2.7 3.6 2.3 2.3 0 01-3.6-2.7L1.8 11.8a2.3 2.3 0 012.7-3.6z" transform="rotate(0)"/></svg></div>
      <h4>Feeding &amp; Nutrition</h4>
      <p>What to feed, how often, and handling an upset stomach.</p>
      <a class="link-quiet" href="#">Read Guide &rarr;</a>
    </div>
<div class="resource-tile">
      <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 8.5c0-2 1.4-3.5 3-3.5.9 0 1.6.6 2 1 .8-.4 1.9-.6 3-.6s2.2.2 3 .6c.4-.4 1.1-1 2-1 1.6 0 3 1.5 3 3.5 0 1.3-.6 2.4-1.5 3l.5 2c.3 1.5-.7 3-2.3 3H8.3c-1.6 0-2.6-1.5-2.3-3l.5-2C5.6 10.9 5 9.8 5 8.5z"/><circle cx="9.5" cy="10.5" r=".6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="14.5" cy="10.5" r=".6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></div>
      <h4>Training Your Puppy</h4>
      <p>Potty, crate, biting, jumping, leash, and recall basics.</p>
      <a class="link-quiet" href="#">Read Guide &rarr;</a>
    </div>
<div class="resource-tile">
      <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 9.5l10-10a3.5 3.5 0 015 5l-10 10a3.5 3.5 0 01-5-5z"/><path d="M13 4.5l6.5 6.5"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="1"/><circle cx="12.5" cy="12.5" r="1"/></svg></div>
      <h4>Puppy Health &amp; Vaccinations</h4>
      <p>Routine care and public-exposure guidance.</p>
      <a class="link-quiet" href="#">Read Guide &rarr;</a>
    </div>
<div class="resource-tile">
      <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l7 3v6c0 4.5-3 7.5-7 9-4-1.5-7-4.5-7-9V6z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></div>
      <h4>Is My Puppy Sick?</h4>
      <p>Warning signs and when to call a veterinarian.</p>
      <a class="link-quiet" href="#">Read Guide &rarr;</a>
    </div>
<div class="resource-tile">
      <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 20s-7.5-4.6-9.5-9C1 7.5 3 4 6.5 4c2 0 3.4 1.2 4 2 .6-.8 2-2 4-2C18 4 20 7.5 18.5 11c-2 4.4-6.5 9-6.5 9z"/></svg></div>
      <h4>Our Favorite Vet Resources</h4>
      <p>Regular vets, emergency options, and affordable care.</p>
      <a class="link-quiet" href="#">Read Guide &rarr;</a>
    </div>
<div class="resource-tile">
      <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="9" width="16" height="11" rx="1.2"/><path d="M4 13h16"/><path d="M12 9v11"/><path d="M12 9C10.5 9 8.5 8 8.5 6.2 8.5 5 9.4 4 10.6 4c1.6 0 1.9 2.5 1.4 5zM12 9c1.5 0 3.5-1 3.5-2.8 0-1.2-.9-2.2-2.1-2.2-1.6 0-1.9 2.5-1.4 5z"/></svg></div>
      <h4>MBPR Favorites &amp; Shopping</h4>
      <p>Crates, pens, toys, and gear we actually recommend.</p>
      <a class="link-quiet" href="#">Read Guide &rarr;</a>
    </div>
<div class="resource-tile">
      <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16v3a4 4 0 01-4 4H8a4 4 0 01-4-4z"/><path d="M4 12V6a2 2 0 012-2h1"/><path d="M9 5.5V4M2.5 19h19"/></svg></div>
      <h4>Grooming &amp; Everyday Care</h4>
      <p>Nails, bathing, brushing, ears, and teeth.</p>
      <a class="link-quiet" href="#">Read Guide &rarr;</a>
    </div>
<div class="resource-tile">
      <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 16V11l2-4.5h12L20 11v5"/><rect x="3.5" y="16" width="17" height="3" rx="1"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="16" r="1.4"/><circle cx="16.5" cy="16" r="1.4"/></svg></div>
      <h4>Travel &amp; Safety</h4>
      <p>Car safety, tags, microchips, heat, and water safety.</p>
      <a class="link-quiet" href="#">Read Guide &rarr;</a>
    </div>
<div class="resource-tile">
      <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s7-6.2 7-11.5A7 7 0 105 9.5C5 14.8 12 21 12 21z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.4"/></svg></div>
      <h4>Rescue &amp; Community Resources</h4>
      <p>County shelters, humane society, and partner rescues.</p>
      <a class="link-quiet" href="#">Read Guide &rarr;</a>
    </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section sand-deep">
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="content-flow">
      <span class="eyebrow">Coming Soon</span>
      <h2>Downloadable Guides</h2>
      <ul class="paw-list">
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 15.5c-2.6 0-5.4 2-5.4 4.6 0 1.3 1 2.2 2.3 2.2.9 0 1.6-.4 2.4-.7.5-.2 1-.4 1.4-.4s.9.2 1.4.4c.8.3 1.5.7 2.4.7 1.3 0 2.3-.9 2.3-2.2 0-2.6-2.6-4.6-5.2-4.6z"/><ellipse cx="5.5" cy="10.8" rx="1.8" ry="2.4"/><ellipse cx="9.5" cy="7.2" rx="1.9" ry="2.6"/><ellipse cx="14.5" cy="7.2" rx="1.9" ry="2.6"/><ellipse cx="18.5" cy="10.8" rx="1.8" ry="2.4"/></svg> <span>Your Puppy&rsquo;s First Night</span></li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 15.5c-2.6 0-5.4 2-5.4 4.6 0 1.3 1 2.2 2.3 2.2.9 0 1.6-.4 2.4-.7.5-.2 1-.4 1.4-.4s.9.2 1.4.4c.8.3 1.5.7 2.4.7 1.3 0 2.3-.9 2.3-2.2 0-2.6-2.6-4.6-5.2-4.6z"/><ellipse cx="5.5" cy="10.8" rx="1.8" ry="2.4"/><ellipse cx="9.5" cy="7.2" rx="1.9" ry="2.6"/><ellipse cx="14.5" cy="7.2" rx="1.9" ry="2.6"/><ellipse cx="18.5" cy="10.8" rx="1.8" ry="2.4"/></svg> <span>Setting Up Your Puppy Pen</span></li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 15.5c-2.6 0-5.4 2-5.4 4.6 0 1.3 1 2.2 2.3 2.2.9 0 1.6-.4 2.4-.7.5-.2 1-.4 1.4-.4s.9.2 1.4.4c.8.3 1.5.7 2.4.7 1.3 0 2.3-.9 2.3-2.2 0-2.6-2.6-4.6-5.2-4.6z"/><ellipse cx="5.5" cy="10.8" rx="1.8" ry="2.4"/><ellipse cx="9.5" cy="7.2" rx="1.9" ry="2.6"/><ellipse cx="14.5" cy="7.2" rx="1.9" ry="2.6"/><ellipse cx="18.5" cy="10.8" rx="1.8" ry="2.4"/></svg> <span>Potty Training Cheat Sheet</span></li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 15.5c-2.6 0-5.4 2-5.4 4.6 0 1.3 1 2.2 2.3 2.2.9 0 1.6-.4 2.4-.7.5-.2 1-.4 1.4-.4s.9.2 1.4.4c.8.3 1.5.7 2.4.7 1.3 0 2.3-.9 2.3-2.2 0-2.6-2.6-4.6-5.2-4.6z"/><ellipse cx="5.5" cy="10.8" rx="1.8" ry="2.4"/><ellipse cx="9.5" cy="7.2" rx="1.9" ry="2.6"/><ellipse cx="14.5" cy="7.2" rx="1.9" ry="2.6"/><ellipse cx="18.5" cy="10.8" rx="1.8" ry="2.4"/></svg> <span>Puppy Vaccine &amp; Public Exposure Guide</span></li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 15.5c-2.6 0-5.4 2-5.4 4.6 0 1.3 1 2.2 2.3 2.2.9 0 1.6-.4 2.4-.7.5-.2 1-.4 1.4-.4s.9.2 1.4.4c.8.3 1.5.7 2.4.7 1.3 0 2.3-.9 2.3-2.2 0-2.6-2.6-4.6-5.2-4.6z"/><ellipse cx="5.5" cy="10.8" rx="1.8" ry="2.4"/><ellipse cx="9.5" cy="7.2" rx="1.9" ry="2.6"/><ellipse cx="14.5" cy="7.2" rx="1.9" ry="2.6"/><ellipse cx="18.5" cy="10.8" rx="1.8" ry="2.4"/></svg> <span>When To Call The Vet</span></li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 15.5c-2.6 0-5.4 2-5.4 4.6 0 1.3 1 2.2 2.3 2.2.9 0 1.6-.4 2.4-.7.5-.2 1-.4 1.4-.4s.9.2 1.4.4c.8.3 1.5.7 2.4.7 1.3 0 2.3-.9 2.3-2.2 0-2.6-2.6-4.6-5.2-4.6z"/><ellipse cx="5.5" cy="10.8" rx="1.8" ry="2.4"/><ellipse cx="9.5" cy="7.2" rx="1.9" ry="2.6"/><ellipse cx="14.5" cy="7.2" rx="1.9" ry="2.6"/><ellipse cx="18.5" cy="10.8" rx="1.8" ry="2.4"/></svg> <span>What To Buy Before Bringing Puppy Home</span></li>
      </ul>
      <p style="opacity:.6; font-size:.85rem;">Medical content will be reviewed against current veterinary guidance before publishing &mdash; these guides help owners recognize urgency, not diagnose.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="media">
      <img src="https://missionbaypuppyrescue.org/cdn/shop/files/happy-black-dog-wide-toothy-grin_1024x1024.webp?v=1738512478" alt="A happy rescue dog">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="partners">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Rescue &amp; Community Partners</span>
    <h2 style="margin-bottom:26px;">Same Goal: Homes For Pups In Need</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-4">
      <div class="resource-tile">
        <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s7-6.2 7-11.5A7 7 0 105 9.5C5 14.8 12 21 12 21z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.4"/></svg></div>
        <h4>County Animal Shelter</h4>
        <p>See available pets at San Diego County Animal Shelters.</p>
        <a class="link-quiet" href="https://www.sddac.com/content/sdc/das/adopt.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Pets &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="resource-tile">
        <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s7-6.2 7-11.5A7 7 0 105 9.5C5 14.8 12 21 12 21z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.4"/></svg></div>
        <h4>San Diego Humane Society</h4>
        <p>See available pets at The San Diego Humane Society.</p>
        <a class="link-quiet" href="https://www.sdhumane.org/adopt/available-pets/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Pets &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="resource-tile">
        <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 8.5c0-2 1.4-3.5 3-3.5.9 0 1.6.6 2 1 .8-.4 1.9-.6 3-.6s2.2.2 3 .6c.4-.4 1.1-1 2-1 1.6 0 3 1.5 3 3.5 0 1.3-.6 2.4-1.5 3l.5 2c.3 1.5-.7 3-2.3 3H8.3c-1.6 0-2.6-1.5-2.3-3l.5-2C5.6 10.9 5 9.8 5 8.5z"/><circle cx="9.5" cy="10.5" r=".6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="14.5" cy="10.5" r=".6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></div>
        <h4>Woof Project Rescue</h4>
        <p>A fellow San Diego-area rescue partner.</p>
        <a class="link-quiet" href="https://www.woofproject.org/availabledogs" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Dogs &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="resource-tile">
        <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 20s-7.5-4.6-9.5-9C1 7.5 3 4 6.5 4c2 0 3.4 1.2 4 2 .6-.8 2-2 4-2C18 4 20 7.5 18.5 11c-2 4.4-6.5 9-6.5 9z"/></svg></div>
        <h4>Pit-Opotamus Puppy Rescue</h4>
        <p>A fellow San Diego-area rescue partner.</p>
        <a class="link-quiet" href="https://www.facebook.com/p/Pit-Opotamus-Puppy-Rescue-100086318779566/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit Page &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</MBPRLayout>